---
// EcosystemSection.astro - Arquitetura de Soluções da Pluri Health
---

<section
  id="ecossistema"
  aria-labelledby="ecossistema-titulo"
  class="snap-page ecosystem-section"
>
  <div class="ecosystem-container">
    
    <div class="ecosystem-header">
      <div class="ecosystem-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        <span>VISÃO DE ECOSSISTEMA</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="ecossistema-titulo" class="ecosystem-title">
        Uma base inteligente. Especialidades dedicadas.
      </h2>
      <p class="ecosystem-desc">
        A Pluri Health desenvolve plataformas com prontuário específico para a rotina de cada área de atuação clínica, compartilhando um motor de agendamentos, segurança e gestão de equipe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid com as Verticais da Pluri Health -->
    <div class="ecosystem-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Pluri Fisio (Disponível) -->
      <div class="vertical-card card-active">
        <div class="card-status-badge badge-launched">
          <span>Disponível Agora</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-image-wrap">
          <img 
            src="/images/card_fisio.jpg" 
            alt="Pluri Fisio - Fisioterapia" 
            class="card-img" 
            loading="lazy" 
          />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-meta">
            <span class="card-category">Fisioterapia & Reabilitação</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Pluri Fisio</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="card-text">
            Evolução rápida na maca, testes ortopédicos, escala de dor EVA e controle inteligente de pacotes.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://plurifisio.com.br" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener" 
            class="vertical-link active-link"
          >
            <span>Acessar plurifisio.com.br</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
              <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Pluri Psi (Em breve) -->
      <div class="vertical-card card-upcoming">
        <div class="card-status-badge badge-soon">
          <span>Em Desenvolvimento</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-image-wrap">
          <img 
            src="/images/card_psi.jpg" 
            alt="Pluri Psi - Psicologia" 
            class="card-img" 
            loading="lazy" 
          />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-meta">
            <span class="card-category">Psicologia & Terapia</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Pluri Psi</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="card-text">
            Sessões protegidas com sigilo absoluto, notas de evolução contínua, recorrência e gestão de pacientes.
          </p>
          <div class="vertical-link disabled-link">
            <span>Disponível em breve</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Pluri Nutri (Em breve) -->
      <div class="vertical-card card-upcoming">
        <div class="card-status-badge badge-soon">
          <span>Em Desenvolvimento</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-image-wrap">
          <img 
            src="/images/card_nutri.jpg" 
            alt="Pluri Nutri - Nutrição" 
            class="card-img" 
            loading="lazy" 
          />
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="card-meta">
            <span class="card-category">Nutrição Clínica</span>
            <h3 class="card-title">Pluri Nutri</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="card-text">
            Cálculos antropométricos, planejamento alimentar e acompanhamento de adesão em linha do tempo.
          </p>
          <div class="vertical-link disabled-link">
            <span>Disponível em breve</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ecosystem-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100svh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    max-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #FAFBFD;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vh, 2.5rem) clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ecosystem-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2.2vh, 1.75rem);
  }

  .ecosystem-header {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .ecosystem-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--clay);
    background: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .pill-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--clay);
  }

  .ecosystem-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.8vmin, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ecosystem-desc {
    font-size: clamp(0.88rem, 1.8vmin, 1.05rem);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    max-width: 64ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .ecosystem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .vertical-card {
    position: relative;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .card-active {
    border-color: rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .card-active:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 114, 255, 0.16);
  }

  .card-upcoming {
    opacity: 0.88;
  }

  .card-status-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    right: 12px;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .badge-launched {
    background: #10B981;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }

  .badge-soon {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .card-image-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(120px, 16vh, 165px);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #E2E8F0;
  }

  .card-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .card-active:hover .card-img {
    transform: scale(1.04);
  }

  .card-body {
    padding: clamp(0.85rem, 1.8vh, 1.25rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .card-category {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0066F5;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--foreground);
    margin: 0.1rem 0;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .vertical-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .active-link {
    color: #0066F5;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .active-link:hover {
    color: #0044b3;
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .disabled-link {
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ecosystem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .card-image-wrap {
      height: 110px;
    }

    .card-upcoming {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
